# Copy to .env and fill in. The real .env is gitignored; this example is not.

# The account that deploys, and therefore owns, both contracts. Owning them means being able to
# upgrade them and to call setResolver, so this key is worth protecting: keep it off any machine
# you don't control and out of anything that gets shared, pasted or backed up.
DEPLOYER_PRIVATE_KEY=

# The address allowed to propose AI-checked pact results. It can only propose — participants can
# dispute, and a disputed result falls back to needing everyone's agreement — so it never moves
# money on its own. Holds a little USDC for gas and nothing else.
RESOLVER=
